    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1vfs_1_1_file" kindref="compound">File</ref> system that tracks the number of calls to the underlying file system. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is particularly useful when wrapped around <computeroutput>RealFileSystem</computeroutput> to add lightweight tracking of expensive syscalls. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
